--- meta
title: Your order [ORDER_NUMBER] has shipped
aria: Your order [ORDER_NUMBER] has shipped
preheader: Tracking is in this email. Movement can take a few hours to appear.
subject: Your order [ORDER_NUMBER] has shipped
footer: transactional
reason: You are receiving this email because a parcel from order [ORDER_NUMBER] left our warehouse for the shipping address on the order.
