--- text
Your order has shipped

Order [ORDER_NUMBER] is on its way to the shipping address below.
[CARRIER] has the parcel, and delivery is estimated for
[DELIVERY_ESTIMATE].

Shipment details

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Carrier: [CARRIER]
Tracking number: [TRACKING_NUMBER]
Estimated delivery: [DELIVERY_ESTIMATE]

Track your parcel:

[TRACKING_URL]

Tracking can take a few hours to show movement. [CARRIER] creates
the label first and scans the parcel later, so the tracking page can
sit empty for a while even though the parcel is with them.

Shipping address

[SHIPPING_ADDRESS]

Items in this shipment

Item: [ITEM_1_NAME]
[ITEM_1_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_1_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_1_AMOUNT]

If order [ORDER_NUMBER] is shipping in more than one parcel, the
rest follows separately. Each parcel gets its own email with its own
tracking number.

If the parcel has not arrived by [DELIVERY_ESTIMATE], reply to this
email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every
message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
